<title>USA: NS&amp;L Bancorp share buyback approved.</title>
<headline>NS&amp;L Bancorp share buyback approved.</headline>
<dateline>NEOSHO, Mo. 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>NS&amp;L Bancorp Inc said Friday it received regulatory approval to begin a stock repurchase program on January 21 to acquire within 12 months up to 75,908 shares, or about 10 percent of its outstanding common.</p>
<p>The corporation previously completed two stock purchase programs in which it bought back a total of 128,732 of its outstanding shares.</p>
<p>NS&amp;L, which had total assets of $61.8 million at September 30, 1996, is a holding company of Neosho S&amp;L Association FA.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
